            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Data represents new technologies\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory includes the construction of a ballastless rail track (track bedding, substructures, catenary system) as well as the construction of tunnels and bridges. Further components of rail track infrastructure, such as signalling infrastructure, train overtaking stations, sound insulation walls and buildings (stations, service garages) are not included in this study. Also land use is not considered, but accounted for in the maintenance and operation, railway track.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
